  "html": "<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:202px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Rattle_tooths_soul.jpg\" title=\"Rattle Tooth's Vengeful Soul\"><img alt=\"Rattle Tooth's Vengeful Soul\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"187\" src=\"/images/Rattle_tooths_soul.jpg\" width=\"200\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Rattle_tooths_soul.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Rattle Tooth's Vengeful Soul</div></div></div>\n<p>When <a href=\"/wiki/Rattle_Tooth's_Ghost\" title=\"Rattle Tooth's Ghost\">Rattle Tooth's Ghost</a> is destroyed in <a href=\"/wiki/Rattle_Tooth's_Revenge\" title=\"Rattle Tooth's Revenge\">Rattle Tooth's Revenge</a>, <strong class=\"selflink\">Rattle Tooth's Vengeful Soul</strong> appears.  He is a Champion Whisker Broodling, strikingly like our old friend <a href=\"/wiki/Dew_Valley_Rattle_Tooth\" title=\"Dew Valley Rattle Tooth\">Dew Valley Rattle Tooth</a> so many dungeons back!  Killing him opens the door to two <a href=\"/wiki/Treasure_Chests\" title=\"Treasure Chests\">Treasure Chests</a> and a teleporter to <a href=\"/wiki/Ratsputin's_Gulag\" title=\"Ratsputin's Gulag\">Ratsputin's Gulag</a> Level 1.\n</p>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
